            "end": 553.634,
            "speaker_label": "SPEAKER_03",
            "participant_id": 104,
            "text": "Moment, haben wir die Laterne nicht beim Händler gelassen?",
            "asr_text": null,
            "confidence_tier": null,
            "review_status": "unreviewed",
            "review_note": null,
            "markers": [],
            "segment_ref": null,
            "knowledge_hints": [],
            "layers": {}
        },
        {
            "id": "p-00549767-speaker-02",
            "start": 549.767,
            "end": 552.767,
            "speaker_label": "SPEAKER_02",
            "participant_id": 103,
            "text": "Nein, die habe ich seit dem Pass im Rucksack.",
            "asr_text": null,
            "confidence_tier": null,
            "review_status": "unreviewed",
            "review_note": null,
            "markers": [],
            "segment_ref": null,
            "knowledge_hints": [],
            "layers": {}
        },
        {
            "id": "p-00557534-speaker-00",
            "start": 557.534,
            "end": 561.267,
            "speaker_label": "SPEAKER_00",
            "participant_id": 101,
            "text": "Eine ältere Frau öffnet. Sie stellt sich als Ysolde vor.",
            "asr_text": null,
            "confidence_tier": null,
            "review_status": "unreviewed",
            "review_note": null,
            "markers": [],
            "segment_ref": null,
            "knowledge_hints": [],
            "layers": {}
        },
        {
            "id": "p-00562167-speaker-01",
            "start": 562.167,
            "end": 566.5,
            "speaker_label": "SPEAKER_01",
            "participant_id": 102,
            "text": "Wir suchen ein Dach für die Nacht und eine Überfahrt morgen früh.",
            "asr_text": null,
            "confidence_tier": null,
            "review_status": "unreviewed",
            "review_note": null,
            "markers": [],
            "segment_ref": null,
            "knowledge_hints": [],
            "layers": {}
        },
        {
            "id": "p-00568100-speaker-00",
            "start": 568.1,
            "end": 572.7,
            "speaker_label": "SPEAKER_00",
            "participant_id": 101,
            "text": "Ysolde mustert euch. „Morgen ist Brückenfest, da setzt niemand über.“",
            "asr_text": null,
            "confidence_tier": null,
            "review_status": "unreviewed",
            "review_note": null,
            "markers": [],
            "segment_ref": null,
            "knowledge_hints": [],
            "layers": {}
        },
        {
            "id": "p-00572900-speaker-03",
            "start": 572.9,
            "end": 575.3,
            "speaker_label": "SPEAKER_03",
            "participant_id": 104,
            "text": "Was genau passiert beim Brückenfest?",
            "asr_text": null,
            "confidence_tier": null,
            "review_status": "unreviewed",
            "review_note": null,
            "markers": [],
            "segment_ref": null,
            "knowledge_hints": [],
            "layers": {}
        },
        {
            "id": "p-00578800-speaker-00",
            "start": 578.8,
            "end": 584.8,
            "speaker_label": "SPEAKER_00",
            "participant_id": 101,
            "text": "Die ganze Stadt schmückt die alte Brücke, und abends wird das Lied der Nebelfrau gesungen.",
            "asr_text": null,
            "confidence_tier": null,
            "review_status": "unreviewed",
            "review_note": null,
            "markers": [],
            "segment_ref": null,
            "knowledge_hints": [],
            "layers": {}
        },
        {
            "id": "p-00585200-speaker-04",
            "start": 585.2,
            "end": 587.4,
            "speaker_label": "SPEAKER_04",
            "participant_id": null,
            "text": "Soll ich schon mal Tee aufsetzen?",
            "asr_text": null,
            "confidence_tier": null,
            "review_status": "unreviewed",
            "review_note": null,
            "markers": [],
            "segment_ref": null,
            "knowledge_hints": [],
            "layers": {}
        },
        {
            "id": "p-00588300-speaker-02",
            "start": 588.3,
            "end": 592.3,
            "speaker_label": "SPEAKER_02",
            "participant_id": 103,
            "text": "Gern, danke. Zurück ins Spiel: ich frage nach der Nebelfrau.",
            "asr_text": null,
            "confidence_tier": null,
            "review_status": "unreviewed",
            "review_note": null,
            "markers": [],
            "segment_ref": null,
            "knowledge_hints": [],
            "layers": {}
        },
        {
            "id": "p-00593900-speaker-00",
            "start": 593.9,
            "end": 600.367,
            "speaker_label": "SPEAKER_00",
            "participant_id": 101,
            "text": "Ysolde wird leiser. „Man sagt, sie holt sich jedes Jahr einen, der zu spät über die Brücke geht.“",
            "asr_text": null,
            "confidence_tier": null,
            "review_status": "unreviewed",
            "review_note": null,
            "markers": [],
            "segment_ref": null,
            "knowledge_hints": [],
            "layers": {}
        },
        {
            "id": "p-00600567-speaker-01",
            "start": 600.567,
            "end": 604.434,
            "speaker_label": "SPEAKER_01",
            "participant_id": 102,
            "text": "Das klingt nach einer …",
            "asr_text": null,
            "confidence_tier": null,
            "review_status": "unreviewed",
            "review_note": null,
            "markers": [],
            "segment_ref": null,
            "knowledge_hints": [],
            "layers": {}
        },
        {
            "id": "p-00607934-speaker-00",
            "start": 607.934,
            "end": 611.067,
            "speaker_label": "SPEAKER_00",
            "participant_id": 101,
            "text": "Würfelt bitte alle einmal auf Menschenkenntnis.",
            "asr_text": null,
            "confidence_tier": null,
            "review_status": "unreviewed",
            "review_note": null,
            "markers": [],
            "segment_ref": null,
            "knowledge_hints": [],
            "layers": {}
        },
        {
            "id": "p-00611467-speaker-03",
            "start": 611.467,
            "end": 612.667,
            "speaker_label": "SPEAKER_03",
            "participant_id": 104,
            "text": "Vierzehn.",
            "asr_text": null,
            "confidence_tier": null,
            "review_status": "unreviewed",
            "review_note": null,
            "markers": [],
            "segment_ref": null,
            "knowledge_hints": [],
            "layers": {}
        },
        {
            "id": "p-00613567-speaker-02",
            "start": 613.567,
            "end": 614.767,
            "speaker_label": "SPEAKER_02",
            "participant_id": 103,
            "text": "Neun, leider.",
            "asr_text": null,
            "confidence_tier": null,
            "review_status": "unreviewed",
            "review_note": null,
            "markers": [],
            "segment_ref": null,
            "knowledge_hints": [],
            "layers": {}
        },
        {
            "id": "p-00616367-speaker-01",
            "start": 616.367,
            "end": 617.7,
            "speaker_label": "SPEAKER_01",
            "participant_id": 102,
            "text": "Siebzehn, plus zwei.",
            "asr_text": null,
            "confidence_tier": null,
            "review_status": "unreviewed",
            "review_note": null,
            "markers": [],
            "segment_ref": null,
            "knowledge_hints": [],
            "layers": {}
        },
        {
            "id": "p-00617900-speaker-00",
            "start": 617.9,
            "end": 622.767,
            "speaker_label": "SPEAKER_00",
            "participant_id": 101,
            "text": "Mira, du merkst, dass Ysolde selbst Angst hat. Sie glaubt die Geschichte.",
            "asr_text": null,
            "confidence_tier": null,
            "review_status": "unreviewed",
            "review_note": null,
            "markers": [],
            "segment_ref": null,
            "knowledge_hints": [],
            "layers": {}
        },
        {
            "id": "p-00626267-speaker-01",
            "start": 626.267,
            "end": 629.6,
            "speaker_label": "SPEAKER_01",
            "participant_id": 102,
            "text": "Ich frage sie ruhig, ob sie jemanden verloren hat.",
            "asr_text": null,
            "confidence_tier": null,
            "review_status": "unreviewed",
            "review_note": null,
            "markers": [],
            "segment_ref": null,
            "knowledge_hints": [],
            "layers": {}
        },
        {
            "id": "p-00630000-speaker-00",
            "start": 630.0,
            "end": 635.667,
            "speaker_label": "SPEAKER_00",
            "participant_id": 101,
            "text": "Sie nickt nur und zeigt auf ein Bild an der Wand, ein junger Mann mit Fährmannsmütze.",
            "asr_text": null,
            "confidence_tier": null,
            "review_status": "unreviewed",
            "review_note": null,
            "markers": [],
            "segment_ref": null,
            "knowledge_hints": [],
            "layers": {}
        },
        {
            "id": "p-00636567-speaker-02",
            "start": 636.567,
            "end": 638.5,
            "speaker_label": "SPEAKER_02",
            "participant_id": 103,
            "text": "Gehörte er zu den Fährleuten?",
            "asr_text": null,
            "confidence_tier": null,
            "review_status": "unreviewed",
            "review_note": null,
            "markers": [],
            "segment_ref": null,
            "knowledge_hints": [],
            "layers": {}
        },
        {
            "id": "p-00640100-speaker-00",
            "start": 640.1,
            "end": 644.367,
            "speaker_label": "SPEAKER_00",
            "participant_id": 101,
            "text": "„Mein Sohn. Vor drei Jahren, in der Nacht nach dem Brückenfest.“",
            "asr_text": null,
            "confidence_tier": null,
            "review_status": "unreviewed",
            "review_note": null,
            "markers": [],
            "segment_ref": null,
            "knowledge_hints": [],
            "layers": {}
        },
        {
            "id": "p-00644567-speaker-03",
            "start": 644.567,
            "end": 649.567,
            "speaker_label": "SPEAKER_03",
            "participant_id": 104,
            "text": "Dann bleiben wir. Ich will sehen, was in der Nacht auf der Brücke passiert.",
            "asr_text": null,
            "confidence_tier": null,
            "review_status": "unreviewed",
            "review_note": null,
            "markers": [],
            "segment_ref": null,
            "knowledge_hints": [],
            "layers": {}
        },
        {
            "id": "p-00653067-speaker-04",
            "start": 653.067,
            "end": 656.134,
            "speaker_label": "SPEAKER_04",
            "participant_id": null,
            "text": "Ist noch Brot da, …",
            "asr_text": null,
            "confidence_tier": null,
            "review_status": "unreviewed",
            "review_note": null,
            "markers": [],
            "segment_ref": null,
            "knowledge_hints": [],
            "layers": {}
        },
        {
            "id": "p-00656534-speaker-01",
            "start": 656.534,
            "end": 660.934,
            "speaker_label": "SPEAKER_01",
            "participant_id": 102,
            "text": "In der Küche liegt noch was. Talia, du wolltest doch Wache halten?",
            "asr_text": null,
            "confidence_tier": null,
            "review_status": "unreviewed",
            "review_note": null,
            "markers": [],
            "segment_ref": null,
            "knowledge_hints": [],
            "layers": {}
        },
        {
            "id": "p-00661834-speaker-03",
            "start": 661.834,
            "end": 665.567,
            "speaker_label": "SPEAKER_03",
            "participant_id": 104,
            "text": "Ja, ich übernehme die erste Wache am Fenster zur Brücke.",
            "asr_text": null,
            "confidence_tier": null,
            "review_status": "unreviewed",
            "review_note": null,
            "markers": [],
            "segment_ref": null,
            "knowledge_hints": [],
            "layers": {}
        },
        {
            "id": "p-00661834-speaker-00",
            "start": 661.834,
            "end": 666.567,
            "speaker_label": "SPEAKER_00",
            "participant_id": 101,
            "text": "Gegen Mitternacht zieht Nebel vom Fluss herauf, dichter als gewöhnlich.",
            "asr_text": null,
            "confidence_tier": null,
            "review_status": "unreviewed",
            "review_note": null,
            "markers": [],
            "segment_ref": null,
            "knowledge_hints": [],
            "layers": {}
        },
        {
            "id": "p-00667367-speaker-03",
            "start": 667.367,
            "end": 669.3,
            "speaker_label": "SPEAKER_03",
            "participant_id": 104,
            "text": "Ich wecke die anderen, leise.",
            "asr_text": null,
            "confidence_tier": null,
            "review_status": "unreviewed",
            "review_note": null,
            "markers": [],
            "segment_ref": null,
            "knowledge_hints": [],
            "layers": {}
        },
        {
            "id": "p-00672800-speaker-02",
            "start": 672.8,
            "end": 677.133,
            "speaker_label": "SPEAKER_02",
            "participant_id": 103,
            "text": "Ich zünde die Laterne an und schirme das Licht mit dem Mantel ab.",
            "asr_text": null,
            "confidence_tier": null,
            "review_status": "unreviewed",
            "review_note": null,
            "markers": [],
            "segment_ref": null,
            "knowledge_hints": [],
            "layers": {}
        },
        {
            "id": "p-00677533-speaker-00",
            "start": 677.533,
            "end": 682.6,
            "speaker_label": "SPEAKER_00",
            "participant_id": 101,
            "text": "Auf der Brücke bewegt sich etwas, eine Gestalt in hellem Tuch, sehr langsam.",
            "asr_text": null,
            "confidence_tier": null,
            "review_status": "unreviewed",
            "review_note": null,
            "markers": [],
            "segment_ref": null,
            "knowledge_hints": [],
            "layers": {}
        },
        {
            "id": "p-00683500-speaker-01",
            "start": 683.5,
            "end": 686.3,
            "speaker_label": "SPEAKER_01",
            "participant_id": 102,
            "text": "Wir gehen zusammen hinaus, niemand allein.",
            "asr_text": null,
            "confidence_tier": null,
            "review_status": "unreviewed",
            "review_note": null,
            "markers": [],
            "segment_ref": null,
            "knowledge_hints": [],
            "layers": {}
        },
        {
            "id": "p-00687900-speaker-00",
            "start": 687.9,
            "end": 692.967,
            "speaker_label": "SPEAKER_00",
            "participant_id": 101,
            "text": "Die Gestalt bleibt in der Mitte der Brücke stehen und dreht sich zu euch um.",
            "asr_text": null,
            "confidence_tier": null,
            "review_status": "unreviewed",
            "review_note": null,
            "markers": [],
            "segment_ref": null,
            "knowledge_hints": [],
            "layers": {}
        },
        {
            "id": "p-00693167-speaker-02",
            "start": 693.167,
            "end": 694.767,
            "speaker_label": "SPEAKER_02",
            "participant_id": 103,
            "text": "Ich rufe: „Wer bist du?“",
            "asr_text": null,
            "confidence_tier": null,
            "review_status": "unreviewed",
            "review_note": null,
            "markers": [],
            "segment_ref": null,
            "knowledge_hints": [],
            "layers": {}
        },
        {
            "id": "p-00698267-speaker-00",
            "start": 698.267,
            "end": 703.4,
            "speaker_label": "SPEAKER_00",
            "participant_id": 101,
            "text": "Keine Antwort. Aber ihr hört leises Singen, die Melodie des Liedes vom Abend.",
            "asr_text": null,
            "confidence_tier": null,
            "review_status": "unreviewed",
            "review_note": null,
            "markers": [],
            "segment_ref": null,
            "knowledge_hints": [],
            "layers": {}
        },
        {
            "id": "p-00703800-speaker-03",
            "start": 703.8,
            "end": 705.8,
            "speaker_label": "SPEAKER_03",
            "participant_id": 104,
            "text": "Ich ziehe nicht, …",
            "asr_text": null,
            "confidence_tier": null,
            "review_status": "unreviewed",
            "review_note": null,
            "markers": [],
            "segment_ref": null,
            "knowledge_hints": [],
            "layers": {}
        },
        {
            "id": "p-00706700-speaker-00",
            "start": 706.7,
            "end": 712.967,
            "speaker_label": "SPEAKER_00",
            "participant_id": 101,
            "text": "Das Licht der Laterne fällt auf das Tuch, und für einen Moment seht ihr kein Gesicht darunter.",
            "asr_text": null,
            "confidence_tier": null,
            "review_status": "unreviewed",
            "review_note": null,
            "markers": [],
            "segment_ref": null,
            "knowledge_hints": [],
            "layers": {}
        },
        {
            "id": "p-00714567-speaker-01",
            "start": 714.567,
            "end": 716.967,
            "speaker_label": "SPEAKER_01",
            "participant_id": 102,
            "text": "Okay, das ist gruselig. Kurze Pause?",
            "asr_text": null,
            "confidence_tier": null,
            "review_status": "unreviewed",
            "review_note": null,
            "markers": [],
            "segment_ref": null,
            "knowledge_hints": [],
            "layers": {}
        },
        {
            "id": "p-00717167-speaker-00",
            "start": 717.167,
            "end": 720.434,
            "speaker_label": "SPEAKER_00",
            "participant_id": 101,
            "text": "Fünf Minuten, dann geht es auf der Brücke weiter.",
            "asr_text": null,
            "confidence_tier": null,
            "review_status": "unreviewed",
            "review_note": null,
            "markers": [],
